From 371b6e8e7820c93d99b295d7550c9e921b2984d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrice Brissette <pbrisset@cisco.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 19:56:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 124/125] bgpd,zebra,lib,fpm: EVPN bridge-port protection

Squashed backport of the current FRRouting/frr PR #24071 implementation to the SONiC FRR 10.7.1 patch stack. Include the shared FPM BPP codec and focused ZAPI/FPM unit tests. The bgp_evpn_mh_bpp topotest is carried in the following patch.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Signed-off-by: Patrice Brissette <pbrisset@cisco.com>
